    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8292" root="حصو and حصى" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ مَحْصَاةٌ</span></b>  <i>A land containing pebbles,</i> or
<i>small stones:</i> (S:) or <i>abounding therewith;</i> (K;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ حَصِيَةٌ</span></b> : and in like manner, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَهْرٌ</span>
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَصَوِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>a river,</i> or <i>rivulet,</i> or <i>the like, abounding therewith.</i> (TA.)

